## Changes Made

All changes are purely ghost/proof annotations inside the three `atomic_with_ghost!` ghost blocks:

### 1. Load ghost block (reading current state)
```rust
match g {
    GhostState::Uninitialized(p) => { g = GhostState::Uninitialized(p); }
    GhostState::Initializing => { g = GhostState::Initializing; }
    GhostState::Initialized(pts) => {
